#: ../../personas/service_catalog.rst:2
msgid "Service Catalog Persona"
msgstr ""

#: ../../personas/service_catalog.rst:4
msgid ""
"The Service Catalog Persona presents a simplified catalog where users can"
" select and deploy Instances or Blueprints with pre-defined configuration"
" with just a few clicks and without presenting an overwhelming list of "
"options."
msgstr ""

#: ../../personas/service_catalog.rst:7
msgid "Configuring Catalog Item Access"
msgstr ""

#: ../../personas/service_catalog.rst:9
msgid ""
"Within the Service Catalog Persona, users are presented with Catalog "
"Items based on their User Role. Additionally, Catalog Item access can be "
"set on the Tenant Role to restrict certain items from all users in the "
"Tenant. By default, User Roles have no access to any catalog items (and "
"no access to the Service Catalog Persona). When enabling Service Catalog "
"Persona access for User Roles, you will also need to give access to some "
"or all Catalog Items."
msgstr ""

#: ../../personas/service_catalog.rst:11
msgid "Configuring Global Access:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../personas/service_catalog.rst:13
msgid "**Full:** Gives access to all Catalog Items"
msgstr ""

#: ../../personas/service_catalog.rst:14
msgid ""
"**Custom:** Gives access to individually-selected items from the list "
"below"
msgstr ""

#: ../../personas/service_catalog.rst:15
msgid "**None:** No access is given to any Catalog Items"
msgstr ""

#: ../../personas/service_catalog.rst:17
msgid "Tip"
msgstr ""

#: ../../personas/service_catalog.rst:17
msgid ""
"When giving Custom access, be sure to set access on some of the "
"individual catalog items to Full in order to reveal those items to the "
"Role group."
msgstr ""

#: ../../personas/service_catalog.rst:20
msgid "Dashboard"
msgstr ""

#: ../../personas/service_catalog.rst:22
msgid ""
"The default page for the Service Catalog Persona is the Dashboard. The "
"Dashboard shows a selection of featured catalog items, a listing of the "
"last few items the user has ordered, and a selection from the user's "
"inventory."
msgstr ""

#: ../../personas/service_catalog.rst
msgid ".. image:: /images/personas/3scDashboard.png"
msgstr ""

#: ../../personas/service_catalog.rst:27
msgid "Catalog"
msgstr ""

#: ../../personas/service_catalog.rst:29
msgid ""
"The catalog shows the complete list of pre-defined catalog items "
"available to the user for provisioning. Catalog items are not created in "
"the Service Catalog Persona. For more on creating catalog items, see the "
"`Self Service section <https://docs.morpheusdata.com/en/latest/tools"
"/self-service.html>`_ (Tools > Self Service) of |morpheus| docs."
msgstr ""

#: ../../personas/service_catalog.rst
msgid ".. image:: /images/personas/4scCatalog.png"
msgstr ""

#: ../../personas/service_catalog.rst:34
msgid "Inventory"
msgstr ""

#: ../../personas/service_catalog.rst:36
msgid ""
"The Inventory Page reveals the complete list of items which have been "
"ordered by the user and provisioned. Users will only see their own items "
"in this section."
msgstr ""

#: ../../personas/service_catalog.rst
msgid ".. image:: /images/personas/5scInventory.png"
msgstr ""

#: ../../personas/service_catalog.rst:41
msgid "Inventory Detail"
msgstr ""

#: ../../personas/service_catalog.rst:43
msgid ""
"Access the detail page for an item in your inventory by clicking the View"
" Details link. The page displayed will look very similar to an Instance "
"or App detail page in the Standard Persona. Highly detailed information "
"on the health of the Instance or App are shown here. We can also take "
"actions against Instances such as running Tasks or Workflows, "
"reconfiguring the Instance, controlling the power state, and more."
msgstr ""

#: ../../personas/service_catalog.rst
msgid ".. image:: /images/personas/6scDetail.png"
msgstr ""

#: ../../personas/service_catalog.rst:48
msgid "Placing Orders"
msgstr ""

#: ../../personas/service_catalog.rst:50
msgid ""
"From the Catalog page, select the tile for your chosen item to see any "
"custom options that may need to be set prior to provisioning."
msgstr ""

#: ../../personas/service_catalog.rst
msgid ".. image:: /images/personas/7catalogOrder.png"
msgstr ""

#: ../../personas/service_catalog.rst:54
msgid ""
"Once the item is in the cart, make any additional selections to complete "
"the order. Once finished, proceed to the cart by clicking on the cart "
"icon at the top of the application window. Click \"Review Order\". When "
"reviewing your order, each selected item is listed along with its "
"estimated cost. The total estimated cost for the entire order is also "
"computed."
msgstr ""

#: ../../personas/service_catalog.rst
msgid ".. image:: /images/personas/8catalogCart.png"
msgstr ""

#: ../../personas/service_catalog.rst:58
msgid ""
"Once :guilabel:`PLACE ORDER` is clicked, the provisioning process will "
"begin and the user is redirected back to the catalog page. Any new orders"
" can be viewed in Inventory and additional details can be accessed "
"through the Inventory item detail page."
msgstr ""

